---
// Subscription-honest proof: live plan-quota status in chat.
---

<div
  class="tg-card tg"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Telegram message from klanker reporting live Claude plan quota: 38 percent of the 5-hour window used, resets at 4:12pm, weekly usage on track with Tuesday the heaviest day, zero API spend, same bill as yesterday."
>
  <div class="tg-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="back">‹</span>
    <span class="who"><b>klanker</b><span>bot</span></span>
    <span class="tg-ava a4">k</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="msg out tail">
      <p>quota?</p>
      <span class="meta">14:05 <span class="ticks">✓✓</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="msg in tail" style="max-width:92%">
      <span class="name">klanker</span>
      <p class="card-title">📊 Plan quota</p>
      <div class="rows">
        <span class="row"><span class="st ok">✓</span><span>5h window: <b>38% used</b>, resets 4:12pm</span></span>
        <span class="row"><span class="st ok">✓</span><span>Week: on track, heaviest day Tuesday</span></span>
        <span class="row"><span class="st ok">✓</span><span>API spend: <b>$0</b> — same bill as yesterday</span></span>
      </div>
      <span class="meta">14:05</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
